# Tutorial 06 - Audio and Music
@scenario {{SCENARIO_PREFIX}}_tutorial_06_audio
@include {{CHARACTERS_INCLUDE}}
{{BG_DECL}}@label start
{{BG_START}}[inc tutorial_count]
[show lavender center talking]
Lavender: Use [bgm], [bgm_fadeout], and [bgm_crossfade] for music flow.
{{BGM_START}}Lavender: Use [sfx] for one-shot sounds and [voice] for spoken lines.
Lavender: Control channel volume with [volume bgm 0.8], [volume sfx 1.0], etc.
{{BGM_FADE}}Lavender: Keep file naming predictable and group by channel in assets/audio/.
> Return to Tutorial Hub -> return_hub

@label return_hub
[goto {{HUB_TARGET}}:topics_page_2]
